{"abstract":[{"text":"A minimum spanning arborescence rooted at ","type":"text"},{"code":"root","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", by Edmonds’ algorithm; nil unless ","type":"text"},{"code":"root","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reaches every vertex.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumSpanningArborescence","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"root","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Vertex"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SpanningTrees9BranchingV","text":"Branching","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/Branching"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeId